@startuml
' Figure 14.2  Continuous batching
' Reading order: top to bottom. The scheduler runs one decode step at a
' time; a finished call leaves at the end of a step and a waiting call
' joins at the next, with its prefill split into chunks so the running
' calls keep their pace. Values from serving.demo --part batching.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Waiting\ncalls" as Q <<ops>>
participant "Scheduler" as S <<model>>
participant "GPU" as G <<model>>
S -> G : Step n: 64 calls
G --> S : Call 17 finishes
S -> S : Free its blocks
Q -> S : Call 65 is admitted
S -> G : Step n+1: 63 + 512-token chunk
S -> G : Step n+2: 64 + next chunk
note over S, G : No call waits for the longest
@enduml
